<title>FRANCE: Air Liquide 96 net up, dividend held.</title>
<headline>Air Liquide 96 net up, dividend held.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net consolidated			   2,773  vs	   2,661</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			 14  vs		14</p>
<p>    Consolidated sales			34,382  vs	  32,189</p>
<p>    Cash flow				    5,969  vs  (up 5.7 pct)</p>
<p>NOTE - Air Liquide Groupe said in a statement its operating and financial results rose 1.7 percent, or 1.5 percent after stripping out currency effects. Growth had been limited by a sluggish climate in Europe, especially France and Germany, and the group's continued strategy of diversifying away from core gas and medical businesses. Air Liquide SA posted net profits of 1,565 million francs versus 1,501 million francs in 1995.</p>
</text>
